positions.description:
Responsible for maintaining a orderly department;
Responsible for assisting customers with product selection and purchase;
Responsible for assisting customers with product support;
Responsible for running merchandise picks for Pick up Today in a timely manner;
Responsible for tracking merchandise in the Walmart Stores SMART Inventory Management System;
Responsible for locating and reporting shrink risks in the electronics department;
Responsible for removing damaged and recalled merchandise from the sales floor;
Responsible for setting and maintaining modular displays / shelving for merchandise.
Also responsible for covering for staffing issues in other areas including but not limited to: Stocking, Photo (Dry Lab), Receiving, Inventory Management, and Front End Registers.

Responsible for working independently to maintain a safe and clean environment inside the facility;
Responsible for basic maintenance of facility equipment;
Responsible for managing inventory of supplies that are used in day to day operations;
Also responsible for covering for staffing issues in other areas including but not limited to: Stocking, Carts / Courtesy, Receiving, Inventory Management, and Front End Registers.

